  "observations": [
    "Seven views show the complete unchanged native shell and clear LEGO holes, with no missing-package through-space.",
    "Front/iso show a smaller closed optical window, metallic raised crown and the real annular recess; no sticker/photo patch is used.",
    "Bottom close view shows the red open-top socket, short contacts, floor and locking tongue.",
    "Default and posed StickS3→HUB→NCIR views show four individual wire cores and both plugs following the actual mouth. Detach keeps the host and HUB.",
    "Two stationary front captures have identical decoded RGB. Native JPEG bytes are retained privately; genuine PNG containers preserve decoded RGB exactly."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Hidden PCB outline/Z, flange thickness/tab, package yaw, crown slope/window recess and clipped leads/solder remain visual inferences.",
    "Small equal-radius circular facets retain finite overlap/gap and intended union/embedded overlaps; figures are in the independent summary.",
    "No sensor, firmware, electrical, optical transport or manufacturing/physical-device validation. Stickers remain deferred; stage stays modeled."
